tion. The industrial designer suggested that the remote control should have a simple design and be made of plastic, as it would be more affordable and appealing to the younger generation. The user interface designer suggested that the remote control should have a menu system, as it would be easier to use and more appealing to the younger generation. The marketing expert suggested that the remote control should be made to appeal to the younger generation, as they are more interested in having a simple and easy-to-use remote control."}
